# Cursor / Grok Bot — PROXY via 🤖 AI 服务
# Official: https://cursor.com/docs/grok-bot/proxies
#           https://cursor.com/docs/enterprise/network-configuration
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX covers nested hosts (e.g. *.*.cursorvm.com).
# Prefer keeping these inline in shadowrocket-AI.conf for single-file clarity
# and reliability; this file is the maintenance copy (optional RULE-SET later).

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.sh
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursorvm.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor-cdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursorapi.com
DOMAIN,accounts.x.ai
DOMAIN,accounts.spacex.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spacex.ai
DOMAIN,connectors-gateway.grok.com
DOMAIN,auth.grokusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grokipedia.com
# api5 / gcpp apex NXDOMAIN; use working hosts (cursor.sh suffix also covers)
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,api5.cursor.sh
DOMAIN,us-only.gcpp.cursor.sh
DOMAIN,anysphere-binaries.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
